		<description><![CDATA[My Dear Friend,
We were first carpententry mates, later rowboat partners and finally, just friends.  Through the 30+ years of that friendship we had so many adventures but what I mainly remember  was your patience, gentle kindess and loving nature.  I learned much from you and will alway be grateful for your presence in my life.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>My Dear Friend,<br />
We were first carpententry mates, later rowboat partners and finally, just friends.  Through the 30+ years of that friendship we had so many adventures but what I mainly remember  was your patience, gentle kindess and loving nature.  I learned much from you and will alway be grateful for your presence in my life.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
