		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=990#comment-13772</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Dear Brother Jelaluddin
    I remember you well from 42 years ago. You were so tall, and strong, but also so quiet, and gentle.  Your presence was soothing, and clean. Your hug was comforting. You were much loved by Murshid Sam, and by all of us in the community. May your gentle spirit shine on forever. Ya Hayoo Ya Qayyum!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Dear Brother Jelaluddin<br />
    I remember you well from 42 years ago. You were so tall, and strong, but also so quiet, and gentle.  Your presence was soothing, and clean. Your hug was comforting. You were much loved by Murshid Sam, and by all of us in the community. May your gentle spirit shine on forever. Ya Hayoo Ya Qayyum!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
